            "right": 760,
            "bottom": 430
          },
          "script": "",
          "style": "Transparent",
          "contents": "Get all 52 cards onto the four foundations at the top right, each suit from ace up to king.\n\nColumns build down in alternating colors: a red 6 goes on a black 7. Any card can go in an empty column, and the four free cells at the top left hold one card each.\n\nDrag a card to move it, with the run on it: as many cards as the free cells and empty columns would let you move one at a time. Or click a card, and it goes to the best place it can. Cards that are no longer needed in the columns go up to the foundations on their own.\n\nUndo (or Edit ▸ Undo) takes back a move at a time. Game numbers match Windows FreeCell's, so you can play the same deal as a friend. Of its first 32,000 deals, only game 11982 can't be won.",
          "text_size": 13,
          "text_style": "plain",
          "text_align": "Left",
          "lock_text": true,
          "dont_wrap": false
        },
